1
00:05:32,727 --> 00:05:38,727
From the dark side to our side.

2
00:11:05,454 --> 00:11:11,454
Hellboy is a fantasy, action film directed by Guillermo del Toro.

3
00:16:38,181 --> 00:16:44,181
In the final days of World War II, the Nazis attempt to
use black magic to aid their dying cause.

4
00:22:10,909 --> 00:22:16,909
The Allies raid the camp where the ceremony is taking place, but not before they
summon a baby demon who is rescued by Allied forces and dubbed "Hellboy".

5
00:27:43,636 --> 00:27:49,636
Sixty years later, Hellboy serves the cause of good rather than evil as an agent in the Bureau of Paranormal Research & Defense, along with
Abe Sapien - a merman with psychic powers, and Liz Sherman - a woman with pyrokinesis, protecting America against dark forces.

6
00:33:16,363 --> 00:33:22,363
Hellboy, played by Ron Perlman.

7
00:38:49,090 --> 00:38:55,090
Elizabeth 'Liz' Sherman, played by Selma Blair.

8
00:44:21,818 --> 00:44:27,818
Abraham 'Abe' Sapien, played by Doug Jones.

9
00:49:54,545 --> 00:50:00,545
Prof. Trevor 'Broom' Bruttenholm, played by John Hurt.

10
00:55:27,272 --> 00:55:33,272
John Myers, played by Rupert Evans.

11
01:01:00,000 --> 01:01:06,000
Tom Manning, played by Jeffrey Tambor.

12
01:06:32,727 --> 01:06:38,727
Hellboy is a 2004 American superhero film based on the Dark
Horse Comics character, created by Mike Mignola.

13
01:12:05,454 --> 01:12:11,454
Written and directed by Guillermo del Toro, it is the first
live-action film in the Hellboy franchise.

14
01:17:38,181 --> 01:17:44,181
Ron Perlman stars as the titular character, alongside Selma Blair,
Jeffrey Tambor, Karel Roden, Rupert Evans, and John Hurt.

15
01:23:10,909 --> 01:23:16,909
The film draws inspiration from the debut comic Hellboy: Seed of Destruction.

16
01:28:43,636 --> 01:28:49,636
In the film, a charismatic demon-turned-investigator named "Hellboy" works with the secretive Bureau of Paranormal Research and Defense to
suppress paranormal threats, when a resurrected sorcerer seeks to make Hellboy fulfill his destiny by triggering the apocalypse.

17
01:34:16,363 --> 01:34:22,363
Hellboy had its premiere at the Mann Village Theater in Los Angeles on March
30, 2004, and was released in the United States on April 2.

18
01:39:49,090 --> 01:39:55,090
The film received generally positive reviews from critics and grossed $99.8
million against a production budget between $60–66 million.

19
01:45:21,818 --> 01:45:27,818
The film was followed by a sequel, Hellboy II: The
Golden Army, in 2008, and two reboots.

20
01:50:54,545 --> 01:51:00,545
The film explores themes of nazi, sacrifice,
superhero, paranormal phenomena, black magic.

21
01:56:27,272 --> 01:56:33,272
The tone is dark.
